{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592290/extras/68e45c2871d3b16bae1fbd553205ed0f.poster.avif?t=1754459333\" width=624 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592290/extras/68e45c2871d3b16bae1fbd553205ed0f.webm?t=1754459333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PARANOIA PLACE is a 1-3 player online co-op survival horror game. Together or alone, you will need to solve puzzles, find items and run from the bloodthirsty demonic killer! The gameplay is designed around the idea of &quot;being thrown into the world&quot;. Isolated and lost inside this nightmare-like world you have to find a way to get out. Each game will be different. Every collectable item will be hidden somewhere else. As the game progresses the unpredictable killer will get even faster and angrier. Patience, attention to detail and overcome your fears is key. The clock's ticking. Play smart and work together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play with friends or struggle alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 4 Difficulty Modes - Simplified, Normal, Hard &amp; Insane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Replayability - Items, keys will always spawn in different locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Large and creepy locations to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Map System - you can see your dropped items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Using special item (camera) you have a chance to protect yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Proximity Voice Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unpredictable and smart Killer AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive Hide-and-Seek</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Challenging and tense Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive 3D Audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy the atmosphere while getting chased</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unblocker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/62dbe981204bcc687f436027c77625db80d2e5b2.jpg"},{"name":"Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/93e8811669f6d0a505d6ff9d32c78d62a4b74d5d.jpg"},{"name":"Hellraiser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/326f97e15c4c1b208e0f83a059624f1331e856de.jpg"},{"name":"Luckyone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/869d56f49c1602002c390953cd7df730a2777832.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Unlocking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/94305beacacc910c3746789191649caea9b58abf.jpg"},{"name":"Why you so serious?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/822d50cf45b4f3b7e0c16069d72ba9e5d7bde185.jpg"},{"name":"Smile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/b538e7c891e4cb2404866134010bd29ce668a7bf.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle Solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/1e9eb89453c68ac0f47098ba602619dee2e46f69.jpg"},{"name":"The Asylum Ritual","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/88e2f0e161225da326459e3ddb44bb4ce7162770.jpg"},{"name":"I'm not crazy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1592290/29b77f4ed08df87c52b019173554b9e171e6a9